return ['domain'=>'zinn-order-updates','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-order-updates','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-09T20:34:16+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-09T20:34:16+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Order Updates'=>'Zinn® Order Updates','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates','SMS and WhatsApp order updates for your store, sent through Zinn® Campaigns under your store\'s own name. Connect in one click; no keys to paste.'=>'Wararka dalabka ee SMS iyo WhatsApp ee dukaankaaga, oo lagu soo diro Zinn® Campaigns iyadoo la adeegsanayo magaca dukaankaaga. Ku xir hal gujin; ma jiraan furayaal la dhejinayo.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Order Updates'=>'Cusboonaysiinta Dalabka','Your store is connected to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Dukaankaagu wuxuu ku xidhan yahay Zinn® Campaigns.','Your store is disconnected. No messages will be sent.'=>'Dukaankaaga waa la jaray. Ma jiro farriimo la diri doono.','That connection took too long or was started in another browser. Press Connect again.'=>'Xiriirkaasi wuxuu qaatay waqti aad u dheer ama waxaa laga bilaabay biraawsar kale. Mar kale taabo Ku xir.','Zinn® did not accept the connection. Press Connect again; if it keeps failing, contact Zinn® support.'=>'Zinn® ma aqbalin xiriirka. Mar kale taabo "Ku xir"; haddii ay sii socoto guul-darradu, la xiriir taageerada Zinn®.','Your site could not reach Zinn®. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then press Connect again.'=>'Boggaagu ma gaari karin Zinn®. Hubi in martigeliyahaagu oggol yahay xiriirrada baxaya, ka dibna mar kale taabo «Ku xir».','Help'=>'Caawinaad','Send your customers SMS and WhatsApp updates about their orders, under your store\'s own name, paid from your Zinn® credit.'=>'U dir macaamiishaada wararka ku saabsan dalabyadooda adigoo isticmaalaya SMS iyo WhatsApp, oo wata magaca dukaankaaga, lagana bixiyay dhibcahaaga Zinn®.','Connect opens Zinn® in this window. Sign in or create an account, approve this store, and you come straight back here. You never paste a key.'=>'Ku xidh waxay ku furaysaa Zinn® daaqadan. Soo gal ama samayso koonto, ansixi dukaankan, waxaadna si toos ah ugu soo noqonaysaa halkan. Waligaa furaha ma dhejisanaysid.','Connect to Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Ku xir Zinn® Campaigns','Connected, but Zinn® could not be reached just now. We will try again shortly.'=>'Waa ku xidhan yahay, laakiin Zinn® lama xidhiidhi karin hadda. Wax yar ka dib ayaannu mar kale isku dayi doonnaa.','Store'=>'Dukaan','Connected'=>'Ku xiran','Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Zinn® Campaigns','Open for your account'=>'U furan koontadaada','Not open for your account yet. Zinn® will e-mail you when it is.'=>'Weli uma furna koontadaada. Zinn® ayaa iimayl kuu soo diri doona marka ay diyaar noqoto.','Disconnect'=>'Kala fur','You are not allowed to connect this store.'=>'Loma oggola inaad ku xirto dukaankan.','You are not allowed to disconnect this store.'=>'Lamaad ogolaan inaad ka goyso dukaankan.','Send me order updates by SMS to my phone number. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to stop.'=>'Iigu soo dir wixii ku cusub dalabka SMS ahaan lambarkayga taleefanka. Waxaa laga yaabaa inay khuseeyaan khidmadaha fariimaha iyo xogta. Ka jawaab STOP si aad u joojiso.','Connection'=>'Xiriirinta','You are not allowed to do that.'=>'Loma oggola inaad taas samayso.','Thank you. You can now ask for help and send reports to Zinn® support.'=>'Mahadsanid. Hadda waxaad codsan kartaa caawimaad waxaadna warbixinno u diri kartaa taageerada Zinn®.','Consent withdrawn. Nothing is sent to Zinn® support until you agree again.'=>'Oggolaanshaha waa lagala noqday. Waxba looma diri doono taageerada Zinn® ilaa aad mar kale ogolaato.','The Zinn® AI could not answer just now. Send your question to the team below; a person will reply.'=>'Zinn® AI ma awoodin inay hadda jawaabto. Su\'aashaada u dir kooxda hoose; qof baa ka jawaabi doona.','Glad that solved it.'=>'Waan ku faraxsanahay in taasi xallisay.','Sent. Your ticket is %s; the team replies here and by e-mail.'=>'Waa la diray. Tikidhkaagu waa %s; kooxdu halkan iyo iimaylka ayay kaga jawaabi doontaa.','Fill in the subject, the message and, while your store is not connected, your e-mail address.'=>'Buuxi mowduuca, farriinta iyo, inta dukaankaagu aanu ku xidhnayn, cinwaankaaga iimaylka.','Zinn® did not accept the ticket. Check the fields and try again; if it keeps failing, e-mail support@zinndigital.com.'=>'Zinn® ma aqbalin tigidhkii. Hubi meelaha bannaan oo isku day mar kale; haddii ay sii socoto guul-darradu, iimayl u dir support@zinndigital.com.','Too many requests in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'Codsiyo aad u badan waqti gaaban gudaheed. Fadlan sug dhowr daqiiqo oo mar kale isku day.','Reply sent.'=>'Jawaabta waa la diray.','That ticket is closed. Send a new ticket instead.'=>'Tigidkaasi waa xidhan yahay. Taas bedelkeeda soo dir tigidh cusub.','Your reply could not be sent. Try again in a moment.'=>'Jawaabtaada lama diri karin. Wax yar ka dib mar kale isku day.','Waiting on Zinn® support'=>'Sugaya taageerada Zinn®','Waiting on you'=>'Adiga ayaa lagu sugayaa','Answered'=>'Waa laga jawaabay','Closed'=>'Xiran','Report a bug'=>'Soo sheeg cillad','Send feedback'=>'Dir ra\'yi-celin','Request a feature'=>'Codso sifo','Ask for help'=>'Weydiiso caawimaad','Versions: WordPress, PHP, this plugin, WooCommerce (and whether it uses HPOS) and the supported plugins we detected'=>'Noocyada: WordPress, PHP, furahan, WooCommerce (iyo haddii ay isticmaasho HPOS) iyo furayaasha la taageero ee aan ogaannay','Your active theme and its version'=>'Mowduucaaga shaqeynaya iyo noociisa','The list of installed plugins, their versions and whether each is active'=>'Liiska furayaasha la rakibay, noocyadooda iyo haddii mid kastaa shaqaynayo','Connection: your store address, whether it is connected, this install\'s id and whether Zinn® answered its last check (never the store\'s token)'=>'Xiriirinta: cinwaanka dukaankaaga, haddii uu ku xiran yahay, id-ga rakibaaddan iyo haddii Zinn® uu ka jawaabay hubintii ugu dambeysay (marnaba astaanta dukaanka)','Zinn® Order Updates: Help'=>'Cusbooneysiinta Dalabka Zinn®: Caawinaad','Withdraw my consent to send help requests'=>'Kala noqo oggolaanshahayga dirista codsiyada caawinta','Help here is answered by Zinn Digital® Ltd. Before anything leaves your site, this is exactly what is sent, and where:'=>'Caawinta halkan waxaa ka jawaabaya Zinn Digital® Ltd. Kahor inta aysan waxba ka bixin goobtaada, tani waa sida saxda ah waxa la diro, iyo meesha loo diro:','A question you type: sent to the Zinn® AI at api.zinndigital.com, which answers from the Zinn® help articles.'=>'Su\'aal aad qorto: waxaa loo diraa Zinn® AI ee api.zinndigital.com, kaas oo kaga jawaabaya maqaallada caawinta ee Zinn®.','A ticket you send: its subject, your message, your admin language and a reply e-mail address, sent to Zinn® support.'=>'Tigidh aad dirto: mawduuciisa, fariintaada, luqaddaada maamulka iyo cinwaanka iimaylka jawaabta, oo loo diray taageerada Zinn®.','Diagnostics: only the blocks you tick, each shown in full before you send. Never the store\'s token, passwords or your customers\' details.'=>'Baaritaannada: kaliya baloogyada aad calaamadeyso, mid kasta oo si buuxda loo muujiyey ka hor inta aadan dirin. Weligaa astaanta dukaanka, furaha sirta ah ama faahfaahinta macaamiishaada.','Your tickets: while your store is connected, this screen reads your tickets and the team\'s replies from Zinn®.'=>'Tigidhadaada: inta dukaankaagu ku xidhan yahay, shaashadani waxay akhrinaysaa tigidhadaada iyo jawaabaha kooxda ee ka socda Zinn®.','We record who agreed and when. You can withdraw at any time on this screen.'=>'Waxaan diiwaangelineynaa cidda oggolaatay iyo goorta ay oggolaatay. Waxaad kala noqon kartaa wakhti kasta shaashadan.','Agree and continue'=>'Oggolow oo sii wad','Ask the Zinn® AI'=>'Waydii Zinn® AI','What do you need help with?'=>'Maxaad caawimaad uga baahan tahay?','Ask'=>'Weydii','Help articles'=>'Maqaallada caawinta','That solved it'=>'Tani way xallisay','Still need help? Send it to the team below.'=>'Weli ma u baahan tahay caawimaad? U dir kooxda hoose.','Send it to the Zinn® team'=>'U dir kooxda Zinn®','What is it?'=>'Waa maxay?','Subject'=>'Mowduuc','What happened? For a bug, the steps that show it.'=>'Maxaa dhacay? Haddii uu qalad yahay, tillaabooyinka muujinaya.','Reply e-mail'=>'Iimaylka jawaabta','Leave empty to use the e-mail of the Zinn® member who connected this store.'=>'Faaruq kaga tag si aad u isticmaasho iimaylka xubinta Zinn® ee ku xidhay dukaankan.','Your store is not connected, so the team replies by e-mail.'=>'Dukaankaagu ma xirna, markaa kooxdu waxay kaga jawaabaysaa iimayl.','Diagnostics (optional). Tick a block to attach it; this is exactly what is sent.'=>'Baaritaanka cilladaha (ikhtiyaari). Sax sanduuqa si aad ugu lifaaqdo; tani waa dhab ahaan waxa la dirayo.','Send to Zinn® support'=>'U dir taageerada Zinn®','My tickets'=>'Tigidhadeyda','Connect your store to follow your tickets here. Until then the team replies by e-mail.'=>'Ku xidh dukaankaaga si aad halkan ugala socoto tikidhadaada. Ilaa waqtigaas kooxdu waxay kaga jawaabaysaa iimayl.','Your tickets could not be loaded just now. Try again in a moment.'=>'Tigidhadaada lama soo shubi karin hadda. Fadlan wax yar ka dib mar kale isku day.','No tickets yet.'=>'Weli ma jiraan wax tigidh.','Zinn® support replied on %s:'=>'Taageerada Zinn® waxay ku jawaabtay %s:','Your reply'=>'Jawaabtaada','Send reply'=>'Dir jawaabta','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaal iyo adeegyo','User guides'=>'Hagayaasha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri hagaha isticmaalaha %s','Hide this'=>'Qari tan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Martigelinta Zinn® ee WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kaydinta maalinlaha ah, wareejinta bilaashka ah iyo qaybta koontaroolka oo loo dhisay dadka maamula wax ka badan hal goob.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibso oo iibi mareegaha dhisan, magacyada domain-ka iyo meelaynta xiriiriyaha, iyadoo lacagta si ammaan ah loo hayo ilaa labada dhinacba ay ku qancaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — shaqaalayso dad shaqadoodu tahay arrintan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqa xorta ah ee adduunka oo dhan: baadh in ka badan 10,000 oo adeegyo diyaarsan oo ka socda qorayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyayaasha iyo khubarada SEO, ama dheji mashruuc oo u oggolow inay dalab soo gudbiyaan.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Fiiri qoraallada soo-deynta ee Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Adeegga cusboonaysiinta ee Zinn® ma bixinin xiriirinta soo dejinta ee cusboonaysiintan. Hubi in boggani gaari karo madasha Zinn®, ka dibna isku day mar kale.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta lagama soo dejisan karin adeegga cusboonaysiinta Zinn® (%s). Fadlan isku day mar kale dhowr daqiiqo ka dib.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusbooneysiinta la soo dejiyay kuma guulaysan hubinta sax ahaanshaha loomana rakibin.']];